    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i see what you mean about the establishment, but calling technical skill \"elitist\" seems a bit extreme. if we stop holding art to any standard of skill or beauty and just judge it by how much it wants to change something, isn't there a risk that we're just looking at propaganda instead of actual art?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
